## A lone sphere lit by one off-axis distant light,
## at the scene's own scale (x1). acnesphere_x1000.rib and
## acnesphere_xsmall.rib are the same scene at x1000 and x0.001, camera
## distance and Clipping scaled with the geometry -- AGENTS.md's default
## camera and Clipping overridden for this fixture on r5b_quadrics.rib's
## own precedent, so a uniformly scaled scene renders the same image
## before scale-dependent self-shadow acne can tell the renders apart.
## Not third-party.
Display "acnesphere_x1.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 400 400 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.2] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [1 1 -5] "to" [0 0 0]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.3] "Kd" [0.9]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
